WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
03:08.520 --> 03:09.800
Your daughter

4
03:09.880 --> 03:12.120
did something wrong. She slapped my daughter.

5
03:12.200 --> 03:15.240
Now I understand why your daughter is so vicious.

6
03:15.320 --> 03:16.960
She has a mother like you.

7
03:17.040 --> 03:18.160
What are you gonna do?

8
03:18.760 --> 03:21.040
Try me and find out.

9
03:21.120 --> 03:23.000
Hathaya wants to steal Raiwin.

10
03:23.080 --> 03:24.240
PREVIOUSLY

11
03:24.320 --> 03:27.440
If anything happens to Hathaya, you're responsible.

12
03:28.400 --> 03:29.840
By the time he finds her…

13
03:31.480 --> 03:32.600
Don't touch me.

14
03:33.680 --> 03:35.560
Enough. Enough!

15
03:42.840 --> 03:44.400
Hurry up.

16
03:44.480 --> 03:47.000
If you want me to let him go,

17
03:47.920 --> 03:48.880
then come here.

18
03:50.760 --> 03:52.640
No. Hathaya.

19
03:52.720 --> 03:54.240
Hathaya, don't!

20
03:54.320 --> 03:55.800
Hold him down.

21
03:56.640 --> 03:58.200
Hathaya, don't go.

22
03:58.280 --> 04:00.800
Come on. Don't make this difficult.

23
04:01.920 --> 04:04.320
I don't like women who refuse me.

24
04:04.400 --> 04:06.720
Come on. I don't like that.

25
04:09.360 --> 04:11.840
Madam. Miss Chayanee.

26
04:24.320 --> 04:26.240
-Hathaya. Hathaya. -Come on.

27
04:27.200 --> 04:28.320
Don't.

28
04:29.360 --> 04:30.440
Come here.

29
04:30.520 --> 04:31.760
Let go…

30
04:35.560 --> 04:38.600
Turn around and look at him.

31
04:47.800 --> 04:50.000
Turn back here.

32
04:50.080 --> 04:52.080
Let her go!

33
04:54.360 --> 04:55.280
Don't!

34
05:00.360 --> 05:02.320
Hey. Where are you going?

35
05:07.360 --> 05:10.040
I heard someone screaming at the construction site.

36
05:10.120 --> 05:11.400
I'm going to check it out.

37
05:12.000 --> 05:14.800
There's nothing in there. But the power went out in the office.

38
05:14.880 --> 05:17.920
I went inside, and everything was scattered everywhere.

39
05:18.000 --> 05:20.240
I think a thief may still be hiding in there.

40
05:20.320 --> 05:22.560
Can you go help catch them? I'll give you ten grand.

41
05:22.640 --> 05:24.640
Go.

42
05:26.720 --> 05:28.520
-Go. -Go ahead.

43
05:30.720 --> 05:32.640
No!

44
05:47.360 --> 05:48.360
Run.

45
05:48.440 --> 05:51.080
Hathaya. Run.

46
05:51.160 --> 05:52.640
Help! Help!

47
05:52.720 --> 05:54.360
-Go after her. -Help!

48
05:58.360 --> 05:59.880
Think you're tough?

49
06:03.800 --> 06:05.560
-Go already. -Help!

50
06:09.320 --> 06:10.640
Miss Hathaya.

51
06:15.480 --> 06:17.160
Help!

52
06:17.240 --> 06:18.920
Help!

53
06:21.720 --> 06:23.960
Let go. Let me go!

54
06:24.040 --> 06:26.600
-Let me go! -Miss Hathaya!

55
06:26.680 --> 06:28.280
-Hey! -Get them!

56
06:29.280 --> 06:32.920
Max. Please help Ramil. Ramil is inside.

57
06:36.200 --> 06:38.480
-Hey! -What?!

58
06:38.560 --> 06:40.360
Get out of here!

59
06:41.520 --> 06:43.200
Ramil, are you okay?

60
06:43.280 --> 06:45.200
-Ramil. Ramil! -Boss!

61
06:45.920 --> 06:46.760
Boss.

62
06:46.840 --> 06:49.880
-Boss. Boss. -Ramil…

63
06:49.960 --> 06:51.560
Max, what do we do?

64
06:51.640 --> 06:52.640
-Max. -Boss.

65
06:53.280 --> 06:54.840
Boss! Wake up.

66
06:54.920 --> 06:56.520
Hey!

67
06:56.600 --> 06:58.160
-Go after them! -Yes.

68
06:58.240 --> 06:59.480
Boss.

69
07:01.160 --> 07:02.280
Boss.

70
07:02.840 --> 07:04.080
Boss, wake up.

71
07:07.840 --> 07:10.480
Ramil…

72
07:11.200 --> 07:12.720
Mom. Aunt Chamoi.

73
07:12.800 --> 07:14.240
Call an ambulance.

74
07:19.320 --> 07:20.200
Call one.

75
07:21.240 --> 07:23.960
-Call an ambulance. -Yes. Yes.

76
07:24.040 --> 07:25.360
Hurry!

77
07:25.440 --> 07:26.880
No one's answering yet.

78
07:28.880 --> 07:29.960
Boss.

79
07:32.440 --> 07:33.560
Ramil.

80
07:34.160 --> 07:36.200
Please wake up.

81
07:47.480 --> 07:48.680
Boss.

82
07:50.320 --> 07:52.680
You don't have to hold me up. I can walk by myself now.

83
07:52.760 --> 07:54.200
Yeah,

84
07:54.280 --> 07:56.400
I guess that IV really gave you some strength.

85
07:56.480 --> 07:57.600
Ow.

86
07:58.280 --> 08:01.160
-Ugh. -Max.

87
08:01.240 --> 08:03.680
Did you make any food? I need to eat before I take my meds.

88
08:03.760 --> 08:07.360
I had to drive all the way to pick you up. When was I supposed to cook?

89
08:07.440 --> 08:09.280
Then we can order something.

90
08:09.360 --> 08:11.040
I already made food for you.

91
08:12.240 --> 08:14.200
Perfect. I'm starving.

92
08:16.360 --> 08:21.040
Max, you can go home now. I can take care of myself.

93
08:22.920 --> 08:26.280
Now that someone's caring for you, you're kicking me out?

94
08:26.360 --> 08:27.920
Not even asking me to stay for lunch?

95
08:29.600 --> 08:31.920
-Max. -Yes?

96
08:33.600 --> 08:35.240
I made some for you too.

97
08:35.320 --> 08:37.280
Miss Hathaya.

98
08:37.360 --> 08:39.919
Are you throwing me out too?

99
08:40.559 --> 08:44.280
No. I know you have to supervise the site while Ramil is recovering.

100
08:44.360 --> 08:45.640
So I made some for you.

101
08:46.400 --> 08:48.320
Come on. Go.

102
08:48.400 --> 08:51.040
-I'm counting on you. -Move your leg.

103
08:51.640 --> 08:53.560
Thank you.

104
08:54.480 --> 08:56.640
-Can't eat here, huh? -Just go.

105
09:28.240 --> 09:30.760
Eat something. You need food before taking your medicine.

106
09:32.280 --> 09:34.760
It still hurts.

107
09:35.360 --> 09:37.400
Whenever I hold a spoon,

108
09:38.200 --> 09:39.880
I get this sharp pain in my wrist.

109
09:44.440 --> 09:45.280
‎That's right.

110
09:46.560 --> 09:49.920
You were beaten all over.

111
09:51.040 --> 09:52.320
You can barely feed yourself.

112
09:52.400 --> 09:54.120
That's probably it.

113
09:55.040 --> 09:56.240
Then…

114
09:57.240 --> 09:59.600
I'll take you back to the hospital. You can be admitted

115
09:59.680 --> 10:01.840
and get nursing care and an IV.

116
10:03.920 --> 10:06.640
I was there for two days already. It was boring.

117
10:08.360 --> 10:09.840
I can feed myself.

118
10:15.840 --> 10:16.760
I'll get you a straw.

119
10:26.000 --> 10:27.560
Do you like it hot?

120
10:27.640 --> 10:30.760
Blow on it too. My mouth hurts. See?

121
10:40.360 --> 10:41.640
It's coming out.

122
10:46.440 --> 10:48.760
Thank you for taking such good care of me.

123
10:49.400 --> 10:50.760
I feel like a VIP.

124
10:53.400 --> 10:55.920
You got hurt because you came to help me.

125
10:57.520 --> 10:58.920
I really am grateful.

126
11:02.160 --> 11:05.560
I never thought something this bad could happen at the development.

127
11:06.720 --> 11:08.960
They called and tricked me into leaving.

128
11:09.040 --> 11:10.880
They planned everything carefully.

129
11:11.560 --> 11:13.680
Do you suspect anyone?

130
11:15.960 --> 11:17.480
I don't know.

131
11:17.560 --> 11:20.280
I don't want to accuse anyone without evidence.

132
11:22.080 --> 11:25.440
Don't worry. I'll keep following up with the police.

133
11:26.480 --> 11:27.680
Hope they're caught soon.

134
11:32.080 --> 11:34.480
You'll have no strength if you don't eat enough.

135
11:35.160 --> 11:36.600
-Want more? -No, too much.

136
11:38.120 --> 11:40.400
-Did you blow on it? -Yes.

137
11:44.440 --> 11:47.200
-Are you full yet? -No. That was only two bites.

138
11:49.600 --> 11:52.240
Father is furious about what happened.

139
11:52.320 --> 11:54.400
He told the police to move faster on the case.

140
11:55.200 --> 11:57.040
Make sure your men stay well hidden,

141
11:57.120 --> 11:58.680
or it will be a big problem.

142
11:58.760 --> 12:00.160
Don't worry.

143
12:00.240 --> 12:02.480
My men are professionals.

144
12:03.320 --> 12:04.680
The vehicle we used was rented,

145
12:04.760 --> 12:06.000
and the plate--

146
12:06.080 --> 12:10.880
Did I hurt you? The plate was fake. So there's nothing to worry about.

147
12:10.960 --> 12:12.240
Don't get careless.

148
12:12.320 --> 12:16.200
And if anything happens, don't drag me into it.

149
12:17.600 --> 12:21.040
You've treated me so well, madam.

150
12:21.120 --> 12:22.400
I'd never turn on you.

151
12:23.400 --> 12:25.560
If we can't get rid of Hathaya,

152
12:25.640 --> 12:27.360
then we'll go after her mother instead.

153
12:36.120 --> 12:37.240
I'm already so stressed.

154
12:59.720 --> 13:01.480
He made plans with me and didn't show up.

155
13:02.440 --> 13:03.880
He won't answer my calls either.

156
13:04.840 --> 13:06.400
Why is he acting like this?

157
13:17.120 --> 13:18.880
Hello, Hathai.

158
13:18.960 --> 13:23.920
Yes, Yai. That night, I went to meet you like we planned.

159
13:24.000 --> 13:27.640
You never showed up. Then I tried calling you, but I couldn't reach you.

160
13:27.720 --> 13:29.080
Where have you been?

161
13:29.160 --> 13:31.000
I'm really sorry.

162
13:31.080 --> 13:32.440
That night…

163
13:32.520 --> 13:33.840
What happened?

164
13:33.920 --> 13:36.760
I was planning to buy you a diamond necklace,

165
13:36.840 --> 13:38.720
but on the way there, I was robbed.

166
13:38.800 --> 13:42.040
They beat me up and took the necklace.

167
13:42.800 --> 13:45.560
I was in the hospital for a while and couldn't contact anyone.

168
13:45.640 --> 13:49.480
As soon as I was discharged, I bought a new phone.

169
13:49.560 --> 13:51.080
You were the first person I called.

170
13:51.160 --> 13:52.840
How are you now?

171
13:52.920 --> 13:55.480
Which hospital are you at? I'll come visit you.

172
13:55.560 --> 13:58.200
I'm much better now. I'm already out of the hospital.

173
13:58.280 --> 14:01.080
I'm actually heading to the police station

174
14:01.160 --> 14:02.600
to check on the case.

175
14:03.680 --> 14:06.360
Okay. I'm worried about you.

176
14:07.160 --> 14:08.400
Hathai.

177
14:09.840 --> 14:10.920
I miss you.

178
14:11.000 --> 14:12.200
Mom.

179
14:12.280 --> 14:13.320
I have to go.

180
14:13.400 --> 14:16.680
My friend, who's a police superintendent, is calling.

181
14:16.760 --> 14:17.920
Mom.

182
14:19.920 --> 14:22.560
-Who are you talking to? -Just a friend.

183
14:23.600 --> 14:25.000
Heading to the office now?

184
14:25.880 --> 14:27.360
I'll go help you.

185
14:29.480 --> 14:30.880
I'll open it for you.

186
14:30.960 --> 14:32.640
Calm down.

187
14:32.720 --> 14:36.480
Hathai said you're putting on an act, madam.

188
14:36.560 --> 14:40.040
She figured it out. She knows you're lying.

189
14:40.680 --> 14:41.760
I know, Chamoi.

190
14:44.000 --> 14:46.280
Stop sticking your nose into everything.

191
14:46.360 --> 14:48.800
At the station, you lied about having a video.

192
14:48.880 --> 14:50.720
What if she actually asked to see it?

193
14:50.800 --> 14:53.680
Oh, madam. I can talk my way out of anything.

194
14:53.760 --> 14:56.080
When it comes to making excuses, you can trust me.

195
14:56.160 --> 15:00.120
Honestly, I probably shouldn't have become a maid.

196
15:00.200 --> 15:01.720
Then what should you be?

197
15:01.800 --> 15:05.200
If you're this good at talking nonsense and making excuses,

198
15:05.280 --> 15:07.120
you should be a politician.

199
15:10.120 --> 15:11.360
Madam.

200
15:11.440 --> 15:14.880
I think pretending to be nice and helping them

201
15:14.960 --> 15:16.560
is not going to make them trust us.

202
15:17.160 --> 15:20.960
Who cares? I just have to play the good person for now.

203
15:21.040 --> 15:22.920
When the time comes, I'll strike.

204
15:23.720 --> 15:25.640
What are you planning?

205
15:27.480 --> 15:28.560
To go see Pong.

206
15:29.800 --> 15:31.960
Every breath she takes is all about Pong.

207
15:32.040 --> 15:33.760
-Chamoi. -Yes.

208
15:41.960 --> 15:45.080
Come on. Faster.

209
15:45.160 --> 15:46.440
Come on.

210
15:46.520 --> 15:49.040
Quickly.

211
15:49.120 --> 15:50.760
Get it done today.

212
15:52.440 --> 15:53.640
Hey.

213
15:53.720 --> 15:55.400
What the hell, boss?

214
15:55.480 --> 15:57.840
I used to box, you know.

215
15:57.920 --> 16:02.680
You grab me like that and you'll end up on the ground.

216
16:06.360 --> 16:10.040
Come on. I'm all man, boss.

217
16:10.120 --> 16:11.680
Don't look at me like that.

218
16:12.240 --> 16:15.280
You can't be thinking those kinds of thoughts.

219
16:18.600 --> 16:20.720
-What? -What happened to your face?

220
16:22.720 --> 16:23.720
Who hit you?

221
16:24.320 --> 16:25.920
What?

222
16:26.000 --> 16:29.920
Yesterday I took the guys out for barbecue.

223
16:30.000 --> 16:31.960
Once the alcohol kicked in, you know how it is.

224
16:32.040 --> 16:34.960
We got into a little fight with the table next to us.

225
16:35.040 --> 16:38.720
I thought you said you used to box. How did your face end up like that?

226
16:39.600 --> 16:42.800
Even a boxer can't handle ten guys at once.

227
16:42.880 --> 16:46.000
If it had been one-on-one, he'd have been flat on the ground.

228
16:46.080 --> 16:48.880
Seriously, boss.

229
16:48.960 --> 16:51.640
Look at your face. If I'd been there that night,

230
16:51.720 --> 16:53.280
none of this would've happened.

231
16:53.920 --> 16:56.840
Your face would still be handsome.

232
16:59.920 --> 17:01.760
What?

233
17:01.840 --> 17:04.000
You're still staring. Anything else you want to ask?

234
17:05.599 --> 17:07.200
I'm going to lunch.

235
17:07.800 --> 17:09.280
I like being on time.

236
17:09.359 --> 17:12.400
Keep working. I'm going to eat.

237
17:13.800 --> 17:15.440
I swear he's got a thing for me.

238
17:17.160 --> 17:19.079
This guy is really annoying, boss.

239
17:24.720 --> 17:25.880
Same build.

240
17:27.119 --> 17:28.000
Huh?

241
17:28.640 --> 17:30.880
What are you thinking, boss?

242
17:32.040 --> 17:33.280
Max, keep an eye on Pong.

243
17:34.840 --> 17:36.200
Liu brought him in.

244
17:37.480 --> 17:38.800
Something's off about him.

245
17:41.240 --> 17:43.360
Trying to mess with me won't be easy.

246
17:44.000 --> 17:46.400
I should've knocked him out cold that night.

247
18:04.360 --> 18:05.640
Yai?

248
18:07.320 --> 18:09.080
Is that you?

249
18:10.120 --> 18:11.680
I'm Pong. Right now I'm not Yai.

250
18:11.760 --> 18:13.240
Yai.

251
18:13.320 --> 18:15.920
-Why the hell is she calling me? -Yai.

252
18:16.520 --> 18:17.600
Yai.

253
18:20.680 --> 18:21.920
Yai.

254
18:22.480 --> 18:25.520
Why are you grabbing me, Chamoi?

255
18:27.280 --> 18:28.240
Oh.

256
18:28.840 --> 18:30.880
Who are you looking for?

257
18:30.960 --> 18:34.680
I thought I saw someone I know. Move.

258
18:34.760 --> 18:37.400
This is a construction site.

259
18:37.480 --> 18:40.440
It's full of workers. You only just came back.

260
18:40.520 --> 18:41.640
Who could you know here?

261
18:43.480 --> 18:44.720
What's this?

262
18:45.320 --> 18:47.880
Suddenly coming here looking for workers?

263
18:47.960 --> 18:49.440
Oh.

264
18:49.520 --> 18:52.120
So coming back to care for your daughter

265
18:52.200 --> 18:55.320
was just an excuse. You really came here

266
18:55.400 --> 18:57.640
to hook up with male workers, didn't you?

267
18:57.720 --> 19:00.320
Chamoi, shut your mouth.

268
19:02.840 --> 19:05.520
If you need help finding someone, just tell me.

269
19:05.600 --> 19:08.400
I know the workers here pretty well.

270
19:08.480 --> 19:09.320
Oh.

271
19:09.880 --> 19:11.280
Was his name Pong?

272
19:12.000 --> 19:13.000
Ugh.

273
19:28.760 --> 19:30.960
-Madam. -Hathai came here

274
19:31.040 --> 19:32.480
to look after her daughter.

275
19:32.560 --> 19:34.400
From now on, wherever you go or do anything,

276
19:34.480 --> 19:35.920
be careful.

277
19:36.000 --> 19:37.760
Don't get caught or drag me into this.

278
19:39.640 --> 19:41.800
Yes, madam. I'll be careful.

279
19:44.240 --> 19:45.800
Go deal with her quickly.

280
19:46.760 --> 19:48.000
Yes.

281
19:51.760 --> 19:54.720
Madam, what did you tell him to do?

282
19:54.800 --> 19:56.600
Can you not ask questions for once?

283
19:56.680 --> 19:59.640
No. I just want to know.

284
19:59.720 --> 20:01.920
And what good does knowing do you?

285
20:02.000 --> 20:05.880
Nothing. I just want to know.

286
20:05.960 --> 20:08.920
Madam, my parents taught me

287
20:09.000 --> 20:11.680
that people should always keep learning.

288
20:13.600 --> 20:15.640
That's called learning.

289
20:15.720 --> 20:19.600
What you do is called being nosy.

290
20:19.680 --> 20:21.440
Thank you.

291
20:23.160 --> 20:26.200
Madam. Wow.

292
20:26.280 --> 20:27.160
That one really hurt.

293
20:27.240 --> 20:30.440
Please tell me what you're planning.

294
20:38.840 --> 20:40.560
His build looked exactly the same.

295
20:42.000 --> 20:43.680
But how could it be him?

296
20:44.480 --> 20:46.840
Yai owns a travel agency.

297
20:53.200 --> 20:55.600
I'm only free tonight.

298
20:55.680 --> 20:57.640
I have to go overseas for several months.

299
20:58.320 --> 20:59.840
Meet me at the same restaurant.

300
21:04.600 --> 21:07.800
Mom. I've finished packing up. Let's go home.

301
21:11.200 --> 21:12.760
Is something wrong?

302
21:13.640 --> 21:15.400
Well,

303
21:16.080 --> 21:19.480
that friend I met last time

304
21:19.560 --> 21:22.120
hasn't gone overseas yet.

305
21:22.200 --> 21:25.680
She wants to have dinner with me again.

306
21:28.560 --> 21:29.640
Go ahead.

307
21:31.360 --> 21:33.200
-Okay. -But I'm coming with you.

308
21:33.800 --> 21:35.440
I want to meet your friend too.

309
21:39.000 --> 21:41.200
Well, maybe next time.

310
21:41.280 --> 21:43.760
She had

311
21:44.520 --> 21:46.320
an argument with her husband,

312
21:46.400 --> 21:48.760
so she wants to have dinner alone

313
21:48.840 --> 21:51.480
with me and talk privately.

314
21:54.320 --> 21:56.960
Then I'll go now.

315
22:11.760 --> 22:14.600
Ramil.

316
22:16.760 --> 22:17.880
Are you busy?

317
22:23.760 --> 22:25.080
You want to follow your mom?

318
22:27.040 --> 22:30.600
Aunt Ann told me Mom has been talking to a man.

319
22:30.680 --> 22:34.240
I asked her about him before, but I still don't know much.

320
22:34.880 --> 22:36.240
I fear she'll get tricked again.

321
23:32.520 --> 23:33.640
Please sit down.

322
23:44.400 --> 23:47.280
Mom came this way. She must be going to the restaurant.

323
23:47.360 --> 23:48.320
Come on.

324
23:55.040 --> 23:56.280
Where's Mom?

325
24:07.480 --> 24:08.320
Yai.

326
24:08.920 --> 24:11.560
Why change your mind and sneak me out the back?

327
24:11.640 --> 24:12.680
Is something wrong?

328
24:36.800 --> 24:39.720
Pong. Hathaya and Ramil

329
24:39.800 --> 24:41.960
are following Hathai.

330
24:42.040 --> 24:43.160
Don't let them catch you.

331
24:45.680 --> 24:48.280
Is something wrong?

332
24:49.080 --> 24:51.600
The police superintendent just called me.

333
24:51.680 --> 24:53.000
He said they caught the thief.

334
24:55.000 --> 24:56.000
-Really? -Yes.

335
24:56.080 --> 24:58.240
He's bringing the recovered property to me.

336
24:58.320 --> 25:00.000
Now I can give you the necklace

337
25:00.080 --> 25:01.280
I bought for you.

338
25:01.360 --> 25:02.440
-Come on. -Alright.

339
25:10.880 --> 25:13.600
If we're meeting the superintendent,

340
25:13.680 --> 25:16.120
shouldn't we go to the police station?

341
25:16.200 --> 25:17.840
I told you before.

342
25:17.920 --> 25:19.600
I'm close with important people.

343
25:19.680 --> 25:21.720
He'll bring it to me here.

344
25:21.800 --> 25:24.680
Then can we wait around here?

345
25:26.200 --> 25:28.040
I'm a VIP member.

346
25:28.120 --> 25:31.080
I think we should wait in that room over there.

347
25:37.480 --> 25:39.160
I know you don't like gambling.

348
25:39.800 --> 25:41.680
So we'll just sit and relax over there.

349
25:42.280 --> 25:43.360
Come on.

350
25:57.440 --> 26:00.000
What would you like? Wine or whiskey?

351
26:09.080 --> 26:12.280
I don't feel good about this. I have no idea where Mom went.

352
26:12.360 --> 26:13.640
Maybe she changed restaurants.

353
26:14.520 --> 26:15.960
Try calling her.

354
26:26.280 --> 26:27.320
HATHAYA

355
26:28.280 --> 26:31.480
My daughter's calling. I should answer.

356
26:31.560 --> 26:32.560
She'll worry.

357
26:48.720 --> 26:51.560
I can't reach Mom anymore.

358
26:51.640 --> 26:53.480
Why would she turn off her phone?

359
26:55.800 --> 26:57.080
Your mom said

360
26:57.160 --> 26:59.160
she was meeting a friend about something private.

361
26:59.240 --> 27:02.160
Maybe it's important and she can't answer.

362
27:04.520 --> 27:07.080
But I can't contact her. Of course I'm worried.

363
27:07.680 --> 27:13.120
Come on. She said she wouldn't do anything wrong again. Don't worry.

364
27:13.720 --> 27:15.240
Let's go home first.

365
27:24.160 --> 27:26.160
This is a private area.

366
27:26.800 --> 27:28.920
We have a strict rule against answering phones.

367
27:30.560 --> 27:31.920
Yai,

368
27:32.000 --> 27:34.240
has the superintendent arrived yet?

369
27:34.320 --> 27:36.360
I want to go home.

370
27:36.440 --> 27:38.400
He messaged me.

371
27:38.480 --> 27:41.120
He already left and should be here soon.

372
27:43.240 --> 27:44.840
Hathai.

373
27:44.920 --> 27:47.040
You're going to be so excited

374
27:48.600 --> 27:50.360
when you see the diamond necklace.

375
27:52.600 --> 27:54.600
Can we do this another day?

376
27:54.680 --> 27:56.200
I think we should go.

377
28:02.240 --> 28:04.720
-Hello, Yai. -Hello, sir.

378
28:05.840 --> 28:09.000
The minister couldn't stop praising you the other day.

379
28:09.080 --> 28:11.080
He said you took excellent care of him.

380
28:12.160 --> 28:13.080
Where are you heading?

381
28:13.160 --> 28:15.600
I arranged to meet the superintendent,

382
28:15.680 --> 28:19.080
but he hasn't arrived yet, and my girlfriend

383
28:19.160 --> 28:20.680
wants to go home.

384
28:21.280 --> 28:24.520
The minister called me and said he's almost here.

385
28:24.600 --> 28:25.960
While you wait,

386
28:26.840 --> 28:28.400
why not play a game or two?

387
28:31.760 --> 28:35.600
Mr. Wichian is the chief's aide. Please stay a little longer.

388
28:36.920 --> 28:38.040
It won't be long.

389
28:43.040 --> 28:43.880
Come on.

390
28:46.080 --> 28:47.040
Just one game.

391
28:49.480 --> 28:51.440
Look at this.

392
29:16.840 --> 29:17.840
Wow.

393
29:21.560 --> 29:22.400
All this.

394
29:38.240 --> 29:39.800
I'm going to the restroom.

395
29:39.880 --> 29:42.520
I'll be back. Play for me while I'm gone.

396
29:58.680 --> 29:59.960
Oh my!

397
30:02.840 --> 30:03.960
-Hey. -I did it.

398
30:04.040 --> 30:06.800
You're really lucky.

399
30:07.560 --> 30:10.840
You're good enough to beat the pros.

400
30:11.480 --> 30:12.800
You should keep playing for me.

401
30:13.640 --> 30:16.760
I'd rather not. I'm afraid I'll lose.

402
30:16.840 --> 30:19.640
Don't be afraid. You're lucky. Trust me.

403
30:19.720 --> 30:21.000
Put it all in.

404
31:00.480 --> 31:01.880
I'm sorry.

405
31:01.960 --> 31:04.520
I lost all your money.

406
31:06.200 --> 31:09.480
It's nothing. That's pocket change to me.

407
31:12.760 --> 31:13.640
I want another chance.

408
31:25.040 --> 31:26.920
May I have your ID card?

409
31:34.040 --> 31:36.600
I left mine in the car.

410
31:36.680 --> 31:38.320
Can I borrow yours for a moment?

411
31:41.120 --> 31:43.040
What for?

412
31:43.120 --> 31:46.200
I'm going to get five million baht in chips.

413
31:46.280 --> 31:49.200
-Five million? -Yes.

414
31:51.080 --> 31:52.680
Don't worry.

415
31:52.760 --> 31:57.200
Your ID is only being used as collateral so I can withdraw five million in chips.

416
31:57.280 --> 32:00.400
I'm the one taking the chips. I'm the one responsible for paying it back.

417
32:01.200 --> 32:05.240
There are procedures they have to follow. Don't worry.

418
32:07.480 --> 32:10.200
It won't bind you to anything. I promise.

419
32:36.440 --> 32:37.720
Thank you.

420
32:42.920 --> 32:45.480
Thank you so much, Hathai.

421
32:51.560 --> 32:52.640
Here are the chips.

422
32:55.320 --> 32:57.360
Come on. Let's win it back.

423
33:04.560 --> 33:07.080
It's late, and I still can't reach Mom.

424
33:08.680 --> 33:12.760
If you're worried, we can go back to that same place and look again.

425
33:12.840 --> 33:14.760
I think Mom went somewhere else.

426
33:15.520 --> 33:18.240
I'm always putting you through so much. I'm sorry.

427
33:19.520 --> 33:20.560
It's fine.

428
33:21.960 --> 33:22.960
I'm happy to help.

429
33:29.240 --> 33:32.040
You should go home and rest.

430
33:33.040 --> 33:34.760
Thank you for everything today.

431
33:35.600 --> 33:36.600
All right.

432
33:37.280 --> 33:38.520
But

433
33:39.640 --> 33:40.760
don't stress too much.

434
33:43.120 --> 33:44.880
Have some faith in your mom.

435
33:44.960 --> 33:47.880
I believe she won't do anything wrong.

436
33:50.280 --> 33:51.600
And if anything happens,

437
33:52.520 --> 33:54.840
call me anytime.

438
33:56.760 --> 33:58.080
Okay.

439
33:59.120 --> 34:00.320
Then I'll go.

440
35:36.600 --> 35:37.920
After you.

441
35:46.240 --> 35:47.880
I'm so sorry.

442
35:47.960 --> 35:50.360
I lost all five million of your money.

443
35:51.520 --> 35:53.000
It's fine.

444
35:53.080 --> 35:54.840
Five million is nothing to me.

445
35:55.440 --> 35:57.280
If I get to stand beside you,

446
35:58.000 --> 35:59.760
that alone makes me happy.

447
36:01.200 --> 36:02.640
Come on. Let's go.

448
36:06.480 --> 36:07.560
Yai.

449
36:08.120 --> 36:09.920
The boss wants the money back tomorrow.

450
36:10.560 --> 36:11.760
What is this?

451
36:12.480 --> 36:14.440
It's only five million.

452
36:14.520 --> 36:16.760
I normally take ten or 20 million in chips

453
36:17.520 --> 36:18.800
and there's never a problem.

454
36:19.560 --> 36:20.880
And let me make something clear.

455
36:20.960 --> 36:22.920
I've never defaulted on a debt.

456
36:23.000 --> 36:25.360
But today it isn't under your name.

457
36:25.440 --> 36:27.880
Then tell your boss those chips

458
36:27.960 --> 36:30.880
are under my woman's name.

459
36:42.640 --> 36:44.320
I'm sorry.

460
36:44.400 --> 36:46.560
I never meant to make you lose that money.

461
36:47.200 --> 36:48.280
It's fine.

462
36:48.360 --> 36:50.880
I'll transfer the money tomorrow, then it's over.

463
36:51.640 --> 36:52.880
So,

464
36:53.680 --> 36:55.080
sleep well tonight.

465
36:56.040 --> 36:57.200
Okay.

466
37:01.400 --> 37:04.160
But why didn't the superintendent

467
37:04.240 --> 37:07.960
bring you the diamond necklace like he was supposed to today?

468
37:09.200 --> 37:13.280
He called me while I was in the restroom.

469
37:13.360 --> 37:14.960
He couldn't make it

470
37:15.040 --> 37:16.480
because something came up with a case.

471
37:17.200 --> 37:18.440
Don't worry.

472
37:18.520 --> 37:21.520
Tomorrow I'll go to his house and pick up the necklace.

473
37:21.600 --> 37:24.280
Then I'll come back

474
37:25.000 --> 37:26.920
and put it around your neck myself.

475
37:27.560 --> 37:28.480
Okay?

476
37:29.400 --> 37:30.720
Okay.

477
37:30.800 --> 37:33.200
Can I ask you one thing?

478
37:34.880 --> 37:37.080
Please don't tell your daughter yet.

479
37:38.200 --> 37:39.560
Why?

480
37:39.640 --> 37:41.920
I want my daughter to meet you.

481
37:42.840 --> 37:44.040
I want it to be a surprise.

482
37:44.840 --> 37:46.880
I want your daughter to be excited

483
37:46.960 --> 37:48.840
when she finds out

484
37:48.920 --> 37:51.160
her mother is going to marry a billionaire.

485
37:55.520 --> 37:56.720
Good night.

486
38:00.200 --> 38:01.440
Yes.

487
38:29.720 --> 38:31.120
Who brought you home, Mom?

488
38:31.200 --> 38:33.080
I saw it was a man.

489
38:34.800 --> 38:36.200
That was my friend's husband.

490
38:36.280 --> 38:38.240
My friend was in the car too.

491
38:39.840 --> 38:42.680
I'm sorry I got home so late.

492
38:43.920 --> 38:45.080
Come on. Let's go to bed.

493
38:45.160 --> 38:47.440
Mom. Where were you?

494
38:47.520 --> 38:49.480
I followed you earlier and couldn't find you.

495
38:51.080 --> 38:53.600
You followed me?

496
38:53.680 --> 38:55.520
No.

497
38:55.600 --> 38:58.280
I stopped by to eat with Ramil.

498
38:58.360 --> 39:00.080
I saw you walking into a restaurant.

499
39:00.160 --> 39:03.160
But when I followed you in, you were gone.

500
39:03.880 --> 39:05.640
My friend

501
39:05.720 --> 39:08.480
changed her mind, so we changed restaurants.

502
39:09.800 --> 39:11.320
So,

503
39:11.400 --> 39:14.520
you don't trust me, do you?

504
39:14.600 --> 39:17.680
You think I must've gone off and done something bad again.

505
39:19.480 --> 39:20.680
How about

506
39:20.760 --> 39:24.120
I just stay in my room and never go anywhere?

507
39:24.200 --> 39:25.680
Would that make you feel better?

508
39:25.760 --> 39:28.360
Mom, that's not what I meant.

509
39:28.440 --> 39:30.160
I'm just worried about you.

510
39:32.080 --> 39:35.240
Do you remember what you promised me?

511
39:35.320 --> 39:37.480
You said you were going to change.

512
39:37.560 --> 39:40.720
No more gambling. No more causing problems.

513
39:42.400 --> 39:45.200
Of course I remember. I haven't forgotten.

514
39:46.040 --> 39:47.160
Let's go to bed. It's late.

515
39:57.120 --> 39:58.520
You've fallen for her, huh?

516
39:59.200 --> 40:00.120
No.

517
40:01.120 --> 40:04.160
I saw you kissing her goodbye.

518
40:04.240 --> 40:06.080
I was just staying in character.

519
40:06.160 --> 40:07.680
I already told you.

520
40:07.760 --> 40:09.480
I'm a professional.

521
40:09.560 --> 40:12.080
A professional doesn't fall in love with the target.

522
40:13.520 --> 40:14.520
Good.

523
40:16.840 --> 40:18.040
Are you jealous?

524
40:20.360 --> 40:22.480
Dream on. Someone like me

525
40:22.560 --> 40:24.640
would never fall for an employee.

526
40:27.640 --> 40:29.080
Sure.

527
40:31.720 --> 40:33.800
Keep the plan moving.

528
40:33.880 --> 40:35.880
I already prepared something for you.

529
40:40.920 --> 40:43.480
-Oh. Please sit down. -Alright.

530
40:45.440 --> 40:48.760
Yai, you said it was urgent. Is something wrong?

531
40:49.920 --> 40:51.240
I'm a man of my word.

532
40:56.840 --> 40:59.160
My most precious piece.

533
40:59.240 --> 41:01.040
The most expensive one in my collection.

534
41:03.400 --> 41:04.600
For you.

535
41:05.600 --> 41:06.880
Wow.

536
41:07.560 --> 41:09.320
It's beautiful.

537
41:10.160 --> 41:13.040
This must have been very expensive.

538
41:13.640 --> 41:15.200
The price doesn't matter.

539
41:15.920 --> 41:19.160
For you, I'll find a way to get anything.

540
41:21.200 --> 41:22.960
But Hathai,

541
41:23.840 --> 41:25.680
keep it safe. Put it in your bag.

542
41:26.720 --> 41:28.920
If a thief sees it, or anyone else sees it

543
41:29.600 --> 41:31.400
and gets greedy,

544
41:32.160 --> 41:33.640
they might rob you.

545
41:33.720 --> 41:35.320
Just like what happened to me.

546
41:38.960 --> 41:40.360
Put it in your bag.

547
41:46.760 --> 41:48.000
Would you like anything to eat?

548
41:48.960 --> 41:50.360
Should we order something?

549
41:59.640 --> 42:01.920
Yai, is something wrong?

550
42:03.640 --> 42:06.360
Well…

551
42:09.720 --> 42:10.800
Huh?

552
42:12.120 --> 42:13.840
He's one of the boss's debt collectors.

553
42:13.920 --> 42:15.240
So,

554
42:15.320 --> 42:17.320
you still haven't paid them?

555
42:20.760 --> 42:22.000
The boss sent me to collect.

556
42:22.680 --> 42:24.640
You said you'd pay by noon today.

557
42:24.720 --> 42:26.160
Show some respect.

558
42:26.760 --> 42:28.160
If I said I'll pay, then I will.

559
42:30.000 --> 42:32.200
What? What are you looking at?

560
42:32.280 --> 42:34.800
That's Hathai. She has nothing to do with this.

561
42:34.880 --> 42:36.360
We follow the law.

562
42:37.280 --> 42:39.760
The person who signed the loan pays the debt.

563
42:41.800 --> 42:44.600
Call your boss. I'll talk to him.

564
42:45.320 --> 42:47.280
-Call him. -The boss went to Italy.

565
42:47.880 --> 42:49.120
Then I'll call him myself.

566
42:49.200 --> 42:50.920
He isn't taking anyone's calls.

567
42:51.000 --> 42:54.720
He gave us strict orders to get the money back.

568
42:54.800 --> 42:57.600
I don't have that kind of money, and I didn't take out a loan.

569
42:57.680 --> 42:59.480
Then whose damn signature is on this?

570
43:00.480 --> 43:01.280
Hey!

571
43:02.840 --> 43:04.360
Please be careful.

572
43:04.440 --> 43:06.520
-Watch out! -Hathai, run.

573
43:06.600 --> 43:08.280
Get out of here.

574
43:08.840 --> 43:10.720
Hey.

575
43:10.800 --> 43:12.680
Don't.

576
43:13.320 --> 43:14.920
The necklace is in her bag. Get it.

577
43:21.840 --> 43:24.400
Hey. Stop.

578
43:27.040 --> 43:29.520
Give me my purse back.

579
43:29.600 --> 43:31.320
Give it back.

580
43:31.400 --> 43:32.760
That's my necklace!

581
43:32.840 --> 43:34.840
This is the interest.

582
43:35.600 --> 43:38.600
Go find the rest of the money and pay it back.

583
43:38.680 --> 43:41.120
I told you I don't have it. I don't have any money.

584
43:41.200 --> 43:42.240
Then go find some.

585
43:42.320 --> 43:44.720
If I don't have any, what do you expect me to do?

586
43:44.800 --> 43:45.680
Then die.

587
43:46.720 --> 43:47.880
Stay back!

588
43:52.720 --> 43:54.520
Hathai. Get in.

589
43:56.080 --> 43:57.040
Stop right there.

590
43:57.120 --> 43:59.160
-Come on. -Go.

591
43:59.240 --> 44:01.720
Yai. Get in quickly.

592
44:03.360 --> 44:05.920
Go. Go.

593
44:06.000 --> 44:08.040
Stop. You bastards.

594
44:23.320 --> 44:24.960
Are you okay?

595
44:26.000 --> 44:27.040
I'm fine.

596
44:27.720 --> 44:28.960
I'm more worried about you.

597
44:36.760 --> 44:38.440
This is Liu, my relative.

598
44:39.480 --> 44:42.400
Thank you so much, Miss Liu, for helping us.

599
44:43.760 --> 44:45.720
I just happened to be driving by.

600
44:45.800 --> 44:47.800
Of course, I had to help my own relative.

601
44:48.880 --> 44:51.840
Hathai, what happened?

602
44:51.920 --> 44:54.160
Why was that thug trying to kill you?

603
45:00.120 --> 45:04.320
Give me a minute to talk to Yai first.

604
45:19.480 --> 45:21.600
You said you were close with those creditors.

605
45:21.680 --> 45:23.960
So why did they beat you like that?

606
45:24.040 --> 45:26.320
If the boss had been here, I could've handled it.

607
45:26.400 --> 45:28.960
But those guys are just underlings. They're drunk on power.

608
45:29.680 --> 45:30.880
I'm sorry

609
45:30.960 --> 45:32.920
I couldn't get the diamond necklace for you.

610
45:34.280 --> 45:36.560
What do we do now?

611
45:36.640 --> 45:38.080
Should we go to the police?

612
45:38.160 --> 45:39.680
No.

613
45:39.760 --> 45:43.080
We owe gambling debt. We were already breaking the law.

614
45:43.160 --> 45:45.240
And those people

615
45:45.320 --> 45:47.280
are connected to a major crime syndicate.

616
45:47.360 --> 45:50.440
They have connections. If we report them, they'll make sure we lose.

617
45:51.520 --> 45:54.160
But there have to be some good people out there.

618
45:54.240 --> 45:57.200
And you know so many powerful people.

619
45:57.280 --> 45:59.160
Surely someone can help us.

620
45:59.240 --> 46:01.320
That would drag my business into this mess.

621
46:02.040 --> 46:06.160
And the senior officer backing me is under investigation for online gambling.

622
46:06.240 --> 46:09.040
He has enough trouble of his own. He won't

623
46:09.120 --> 46:10.360
publicly step in to help me.

624
46:11.440 --> 46:13.120
Then what are we supposed to do?

625
46:13.200 --> 46:15.720
I don't have five million to repay them.

626
46:16.520 --> 46:18.280
Don't worry.

627
46:18.360 --> 46:21.280
It's only five million. I can easily find that kind of money.

628
46:21.360 --> 46:23.760
Then why don't you pay it now?

629
46:23.840 --> 46:26.080
I want to clear the debt.

630
46:26.160 --> 46:28.600
I know this sounds like an excuse,

631
46:28.680 --> 46:31.800
but the powerful partner who invested in my travel agency

632
46:31.880 --> 46:34.320
is now tied to a call-center scam investigation.

633
46:34.920 --> 46:38.120
Do you know that almost a billion baht of my money has been frozen?

634
46:38.200 --> 46:40.200
Then what are we supposed to do?

635
46:40.280 --> 46:41.920
From what I checked most recently,

636
46:42.000 --> 46:44.520
I'm not connected to any of those financial transactions.

637
46:44.600 --> 46:46.880
So they should release my money soon.

638
46:47.680 --> 46:49.960
The problem is, it won't be in time.

639
46:50.040 --> 46:51.040
Could I

640
46:51.960 --> 46:54.440
borrow five million from you first?

641
46:55.240 --> 46:56.440
Just for three days.

642
46:56.520 --> 46:58.480
Once they release all my money,

643
46:59.080 --> 47:00.680
I'll give you 50 million back.

644
47:02.520 --> 47:04.680
Hathai. I'm sorry

645
47:04.760 --> 47:06.320
for putting you in this position.

646
47:07.360 --> 47:08.520
It's only three days.

647
47:15.760 --> 47:16.720
Hello, sir.

648
47:17.840 --> 47:19.200
Yes.

649
47:20.960 --> 47:24.120
Really? The order has already been signed?

650
47:24.720 --> 47:26.240
Thank you so much, sir.

651
47:26.320 --> 47:28.680
Thank you for helping me.

652
47:29.680 --> 47:31.840
See? My assets are no longer frozen.

653
47:31.920 --> 47:33.640
I'll get my money back soon.

654
47:34.800 --> 47:36.200
So,

655
47:37.400 --> 47:38.880
please lend me the five million first.

656
47:38.960 --> 47:42.320
I know you love me.

657
47:43.160 --> 47:44.960
You know where to bring the money.

658
47:45.760 --> 47:48.800
The same place. I have to go now.

659
48:08.720 --> 48:10.600
Why did you help me?

660
48:12.960 --> 48:15.360
I'm not saying I want us to suddenly be close,

661
48:16.040 --> 48:17.720
but how could I

662
48:17.800 --> 48:19.600
watch family die right in front of me?

663
48:20.280 --> 48:21.720
Thank you.

664
48:22.880 --> 48:24.080
Thank you so much.

665
48:26.240 --> 48:28.720
Are you going to tell me what happened now?

666
48:32.880 --> 48:37.200
But if you still think of me as your enemy, then forget it.

667
48:46.800 --> 48:48.160
I'll tell you.

668
48:49.760 --> 48:51.200
Then tell me what happened.

669
48:51.840 --> 48:53.480
And tell me if I can do anything.

670
49:07.960 --> 49:10.120
What are you thinking about?

671
49:13.680 --> 49:16.160
It's Pong.

672
49:17.200 --> 49:20.000
The night it happened, someone called me.

673
49:22.080 --> 49:25.200
But when I went out there, nothing had happened at all.

674
49:25.280 --> 49:27.280
So I can't stop thinking that

675
49:27.360 --> 49:30.320
what happened could be connected

676
49:31.440 --> 49:32.640
to whoever attacked you.

677
49:36.280 --> 49:38.240
Wait until Hathai and Hathaya

678
49:38.320 --> 49:40.720
get kicked out of the house.

679
49:40.800 --> 49:42.840
Your mom is deep in gambling debt.

680
49:42.920 --> 49:44.760
‎NEXT EPISODE

681
49:46.400 --> 49:49.160
-Give me the bag. -And what if I don't?

682
49:49.760 --> 49:50.920
What are you going to do about it, madam?

683
49:51.000 --> 49:53.440
He isn't some wealthy tycoon, and his name isn't Yai either.

684
49:54.320 --> 49:55.680
His name is Pong.

685
49:55.760 --> 49:56.600
I'm sorry.

686
49:58.960 --> 50:01.200
Can you forgive me?

687
50:02.240 --> 50:03.680
Mom did something wrong.

688
50:04.360 --> 50:06.400
So I'll leave this house with her.

689
51:58.960 --> 52:02.680
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen

690
52:02.680 --> 52:03.680
